**Scenario**: Order has a `@OneToMany` list of `OrderItem` with LAZY loading.
```java
List<Order> orders = orderRepo.findAll(); // 1 query: SELECT * FROM orders
for (Order order : orders) {
    order.getItems().size(); // N queries: one per order!
}
// Total: 1 + N queries = N+1 problem
```

**Fix with JOIN FETCH**:
```java
@Query("SELECT o FROM Order o JOIN FETCH o.items")
List<Order> findAllWithItems(); // 1 query with JOIN — returns all data
```
